# prompts/summarization/.gitkeep
# --------------------------------
# Document summarization prompt templates will be stored here.
# These templates instruct the LLM to produce concise, structured summaries
# from full documents or retrieved chunks at various levels of detail.
# Example files (future phases):
#   - brief_summary.txt        (one-paragraph executive summary)
#   - detailed_summary.txt     (section-by-section breakdown)
#   - bullet_summary.txt       (key points in bullet format)
